cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LeanPhy: conditional verification for theoretical physics"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and mathlib library for checking theoretical-physics derivations
  from explicit mathematical and physical assumptions.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean
  - theorem proving
  - formal methods
  - theoretical physics
  - quantum mechanics
  - quantum field theory
  - functional analysis
  - mathematical physics
message: "If you use LeanPhy, cite the exact release and generated research ledger."
authors:
  - name: "LeanPhy contributors"
